PS4 Save Remote
================

This project is a derivative of Apollo Save Tool (PS4) by Damian Parrino (bucanero),
licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

  https://github.com/bucanero/apollo-ps4

Modifications in this fork add a LAN HTTP agent API and a PC companion focused on
save decrypt / resign for the same Account-ID. Trophy features are planned separately.

If you redistribute binaries of the PS4 agent, you must also provide corresponding
source code under GPL-3.0.
